---
title: Ketamine Assisted Psychotherapy
status: published
date: 2019-12-10
author: David Nichol
---

I now provide ketamine assisted psychotherapy for depression, PTSD, substance abuse, and self-exploration.

The format is a two-hour session for intramuscular ketamine early in the week and a one-hour session two or three days later to process and integrate the experience.

[https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1080/02791072.1997.10400185](https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1080/02791072.1997.10400185){target="_blank"}